BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 615.0 Td (in the schedule. The sum insured is the most we pay for all claims in one policy year. Payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 601.5 Td (is made either directly to a network hospital \(cashless\) or to you as a reimbursement.) Tj ET
