BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 568.0 Td (Premium may be paid annually or in quarterly installments. A grace period of 30 days applies to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 554.5 Td (each installment. Cover continues during the grace period, but if the premium is still unpaid) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 541.0 Td (when it ends the policy lapses. No claim is payable for any hospitalisation that begins on or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 527.5 Td (after the date of lapse, and any continuity benefits already earned against waiting periods are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 514.0 Td (lost.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 56.0 489.5 Td (SECTION 2 - DEFINITIONS) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 56.0 471.5 Td (2.1 Terms used in this policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 456.5 Td (Hospitalisation means admission to a hospital as an inpatient for a minimum of 24 consecutive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 443.0 Td (hours on the advice of a medical practitioner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 424.5 Td (Day care treatment means a medical or surgical procedure that needs less than 24 hours of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 411.0 Td (hospital stay because of technological advancement, and that would otherwise have required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 397.5 Td (hospitalisation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 379.0 Td (Pre-existing disease means any condition, ailment, injury or disease that was diagnosed by a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 365.5 Td (physician, or for which medical advice or treatment was received, within 48 months before the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 352.0 Td (first policy issued by us.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 333.5 Td (Network hospital means a hospital that has an agreement with us to provide cashless treatment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 315.0 Td (Medically necessary means treatment that is required for the medical management of the illness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 301.5 Td (or injury, follows accepted medical practice, and could not safely be given at a lower level of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 288.0 Td (care.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 269.5 Td (Continuous coverage means uninterrupted cover under this policy, or a previous health policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56.0 256.0 Td (ported to us, renewed within the grace period each year.) Tj ET
